    "value": "{\"device_id\": {\"smoke\": \"0\", \"baseline\": \"0\", \"extended\": \"0\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"dtype\": {\"smoke\": \"FP64\", \"baseline\": \"FP64\", \"extended\": \"FP64\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"block_size\": {\"smoke\": \"256\", \"baseline\": \"256\", \"extended\": \"256\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"array_size\": {\"smoke\": \"1048576\", \"baseline\": \"268435456\", \"extended\": \"536870912\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"kernels\": {\"smoke\": \"Copy,Mul,Add,Triad,Dot\", \"baseline\": \"Copy,Mul,Add,Triad,Dot\", \"extended\": \"Copy,Mul,Add,Triad,Dot\", \"notes\": \"Sweep/list value. Command column documents it; omit this flag so yaml expands cases.\"}, \"warmup_iters\": {\"smoke\": \"1\", \"baseline\": \"2\", \"extended\": \"5\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"num_iterations\": {\"smoke\": \"2\", \"baseline\": \"30000\", \"extended\": \"35550\", \"notes\": \"H100 2026-08-16 probe 1000 -> 11s (1.66ms/kernel). Predict 19000 -> ~209s. Do not copy AMD 30000. Extended 54000 extrapolated ~10:00, not tested. Retimed 2026-08-17 toward 3-4 min baseline; extended scaled by the same factor. 2026-08-18 retune: baseline>=3min / extended>=10min or extended~15min; NVIDIA copied from AMD. | 2026-09-24 GARY_LEDGER (runtime_ledger_ALL_FOUR / Edit3, Gary questions; targets baseline ~4:00 in 3-5 min, extended ~11:30 in 8-15 min): values NOT changed. 5-7s runs with ~42,000,000 GB/s are a build/launch failure, not a parameter problem: 215 (24.04 twin, same 30000) runs 4:17 at ~3,280 GB/s. babelstream-hbm-nvidia now builds for the detected GPU arch and fails on kernel-launch errors / impossible bandwidth; re-measure 415 before retuning.\"}, \"output_format\": {\"smoke\": \"csv\", \"baseline\": \"csv\", \"extended\": \"csv\", \"notes\": \"\"}}"
